| Metric | Result |
|--------|--------|
| Attack Reception Latency | <100ms |
| LLM Analysis Time | 3-5 seconds |
| Pod Startup Time | 5-10 seconds |
| Health Check Response | <50ms |
| Database Query | <10ms |

