## ðŸ›¡ï¸ Smart City Services (Vulnerable by Design)

### 1. Traffic Camera Service ðŸ“¹

**Purpose:** Manage traffic cameras across the city

### Endpoints

```bash
GET  /health                        â†’ Service status

GET  /api/cameras                   â†’ List all cameras (NO AUTH)
GET  /api/camera/{id}/stream        â†’ Video stream URL
GET  /api/analytics                 â†’ Traffic data (SENSITIVE!)
POST /admin/config                  â†’ Admin settings (NO AUTH! ðŸš¨)
```bash

- âŒ `/admin/config` has NO authentication
- âŒ `/api/analytics` exposes sensitive traffic data
- âŒ No rate limiting â†’ Easy DDoS target
- âŒ No input validation

### 2. Healthcare API Service ðŸ¥

**Purpose:** Manage patient data and prescriptions

### Endpoints

```bash
GET  /health                        â†’ Service status

GET  /api/patients                  â†’ List patients (HIPAA VIOLATION!)
GET  /api/patient/{id}              â†’ Patient details (SENSITIVE!)
POST /api/prescriptions/{id}        â†’ Add prescription (NO VALIDATION!)
GET  /admin/logs                    â†’ Admin logs (NO AUTH!)
```bash

- âŒ Patient data exposed without authentication
- âŒ No input validation on prescriptions
- âŒ HIPAA-sensitive data not encrypted
- âŒ Admin access unprotected

### 3. Parking System Service ðŸš—

**Purpose:** Manage parking lots and payments

### Endpoints

```bash
GET  /health                        â†’ Service status

GET  /api/lots                      â†’ Available spots
POST /api/lot/{id}/reserve          â†’ Reserve a spot
POST /api/payment                   â†’ Process payment
GET  /api/transactions              â†’ Payment history (NO AUTH!)
GET  /admin/system-status           â†’ Admin panel (NO AUTH!)
```bash

- âŒ Payment data logged in plain text (ðŸ˜±)
- âŒ No encryption on payment endpoint
- âŒ Transaction history exposed
- âŒ Admin panel unprotected

