â”œâ”€â”€ config.py
â”œâ”€â”€ database.py       â† sync DB
â”œâ”€â”€ governance.py
â”œâ”€â”€ llm_manager.py
â””â”€â”€ llm_providers/
```

### 3.2 After (Modular)

```
services/ids-api/src/
