This operator interface transforms security from:
- **"What is the system doing?"** â†’ **"I understand why, I trust the decision, and I have full control"**
- **"Tool forces decisions on me"** â†’ **"Tool helps me make better decisions"**
- **"Expensive to operate"** â†’ **"Operator becomes 10x more effective"**

That's the dissertation-level difference.
